  "danmaku": [
    {
      "text": "别急，我先把你们的套路读完。",
      "color": "#b3ffc1",
      "y": 700,
      "speed": 340,
      "font_size": 46,
      "direction": -1,
      "start": 0.35,
      "player_id": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "我不连手，但我连胜。",
      "color": "#8ed8ee",
      "y": 820,
      "speed": 270,
      "font_size": 58,
      "direction": 1,
      "start": 0.6,
      "player_id": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "前半冲太快，后半先喘口气。",
      "color": "#ffd790",
      "y": 980,
      "speed": 410,
      "font_size": 44,
      "direction": -1,
      "start": 0.95,
      "player_id": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "剪刀不是偏科，是稳定输出。",
      "color": "#b9a8ff",
      "y": 1140,
      "speed": 300,
      "font_size": 52,
      "direction": 1,
      "start": 1.25,
      "player_id": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "管你出什么，反正我要纯随机。",
      "color": "#9fe4c1",
      "y": 1290,
      "speed": 380,
      "font_size": 48,
      "direction": -1,
      "start": 1.55,
      "player_id": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "哎呀，我怎么出了这么多石头啊。",
      "color": "#a7d7ff",
      "y": 760,
      "speed": 450,
      "font_size": 42,
      "direction": 1,
      "start": 2.05,
      "player_id": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "前半送的分，后半我收回来了。",
      "color": "#ffb38c",
      "y": 900,
      "speed": 290,
      "font_size": 60,
      "direction": -1,
      "start": 2.45,
      "player_id": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "我很均衡，分数不太均衡。",
      "color": "#8ed8ee",
      "y": 1060,
      "speed": 360,
      "font_size": 45,
      "direction": 1,
      "start": 2.85,
      "player_id": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "布阵很厚，胜负看运。",
      "color": "#e1c5ff",
      "y": 1220,
      "speed": 420,
      "font_size": 50,
      "direction": -1,
      "start": 3.25,
      "player_id": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "前半挨揍，后半止血。",
      "color": "#ffc08d",
      "y": 680,
      "speed": 315,
      "font_size": 54,
      "direction": 1,
      "start": 3.7,
      "player_id": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "我很优雅地随机，然后优雅地输。",
      "color": "#d6dce8",
      "y": 880,
      "speed": 395,
      "font_size": 46,
      "direction": -1,
      "start": 4.1,
      "player_id": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "记得太多，赢得太少。",
